<title>FRANCE: Navigation Mixte back in the black in H1.</title>
<headline>Navigation Mixte back in the black in H1.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable profit		    651  vs  loss	65</p>
<p>    Net profit				     562  vs  loss	57</p>
<p>    Operating					189  vs	     427</p>
<p>    Exceptional gain			   1,921  vs  loss	12</p>
<p>NOTE - Navigation Mixte said in a financial announcement in newspapers that asset gains were made on the sale of Cie Francaise de Sucrerie but it made write-downs on its stakes in Paribas and Allianz Via Holding. It said it could not give a forecast for 1996.</p>
<p>Paribas is trying to buy out minorities from Navigation Mixte.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
